<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merck price target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merck price target raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette analyst Kent Blair said he raised his 12-month price target on Merck and Co Inc to $120 from $105.</p>
<p>-- said reiterated buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Blair said if company reports strong second quarter sales of its cholesterol-lowering drug Zocor, which he said he thinks it will, it will be positive for the stock.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1-3/8 to 101-3/8.</p>
</text>
